      "evidence": "Sales rankings from the American Hosta Society (2022‑2024) place variegated cultivars like ‘Patriot’ and gold‑leaf cultivars like ‘Gold Standard’ in the top 10% of all hosta sales; surveys of garden centre customers rank these for visual appeal over solid‑green types.",
